# Operational Standards
- Always use Python 3.11+ async patterns (asyncio.TaskGroup).
- All inter-agent data passing must use strict Pydantic v2 schemas.
- Every tool/query must filter by tenant_id ("ams_retail", "ams_assoc", "mvm_dist", "dream_sleep", "ALL").
